{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 04. Partial profiles
  File       : case4-partial.liquid
  Class      : Case 4 (marketing — unsubscribe required)
  Trigger    : First 4 profiles complete, survey-linked profiles outstanding
  Tone        : profile

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. {{ member.first_name | default: "You" }} are a {{ p.rank }} now — {{ p.points }} points banked
    2. {{ p.done }} capsules collected. The rest pay the same
    3. You are {{ p.to_dollar_points }} points from your next dollar

  PREHEADER
    {{ p.to_dollar_profiles }} more {% if p.to_dollar_profiles == 1 %}profile takes{% else %}profiles take{% endif %} you to your next dollar. Two to three minutes each.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Collect my next capsule  ->  links.profiles

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/case4-partial.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/case4-partial.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
